implementationPlan.description:
scripts/moe-agent.ps1: twin `Enable-MoeWorktreeConfig`, called in Initialize-MoeWorktree right before W's sparse-checkout (~:2978), with exactly the step-1 semantics:
- the same 5 attempts;
- the same `MOE_WORKTREE_CONFIG_RETRY attempt=<n>/5: …` line, byte-identical text (parity-check compares the MOE_WORKTREE_ code sets; also read mem:gotcha-parity-check-literals);
- the same core.worktree/core.bare skip;
- the same failure route into `Stop-MoeWorktreeSeat 'MOE_WORKTREE_CREATE_FAILED' …` with the existing added-W cleanup.

Use the file's existing Invoke-MoeGit helper with -MergeStderr. Set `$env:LC_ALL='C'` only around the write, in try/finally, restoring the previous value (or removing it if unset). Sleep with Start-Sleep -Milliseconds and a jitter.

Windows PowerShell 5.1 compatible: no ternary, no `??`, no pipeline-chain operators.

Keep the file UTF-8 with BOM: edit with the Edit tool only, never a shell rewrite. bash scripts/tests/parity-check.sh must pass.

Verification. Run ONCE, fresh, from the repo root, as ONE command: `node scripts/tests/postflight-safe.mjs bash && bash scripts/tests/worktree-landing.sh && bash scripts/tests/parity-check.sh`.

Run it in place only if `git status --short scripts/` shows nothing but this task's three files. Otherwise run it from a `git archive HEAD` snapshot with exactly those files copied in and cmp-checked (mem:gotcha-gate-hermetic-snapshot-from-wsl).

postflight-safe takes about 15-25 min. Run it under nohup with a log and an .exit file, and poll it in the foreground until it finishes. Never end the turn with it running.

Windows leg (DoD 4): `node.exe scripts/tests/postflight-safe.mjs powershell` from a /mnt/d copy of the same bytes, per mem:gotcha-qa-windows-launcher-tests-from-wsl and mem:gotcha-postflight-worktree-mutant-copy.

Record in the summary:
- the exit codes;
- postflight-safe's JSON summary, with failureClass NONE and no SKIP;
- the worktree-landing counts;
- parity PASS;
- the Windows result.

A faster dev loop while iterating: `MOE_WORKTREE_ONLY=wt-config-lock,wt-config-lock-exhausted,wt-config-other,wt-config-preset node scripts/tests/postflight-worktree.cjs sh scripts/moe-agent.sh <tmp>/fake-proxy.js <tmp> "$(command -v bash)"`.
